tyle="position: relative; display: inline-block; opacity: 1; translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate3d(0px, 0px, 0px);">l</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="gsap_split_letter gsap_split_letter20" style="position: relative; display: inline-block; opacity: 1; translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate3d(0px, 0px, 0px);">e</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="gsap_split_letter gsap_split_letter21" style="position: relative; display: inline-block; opacity: 1; translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate3d(0px, 0px, 0px);">a</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="gsap_split_letter gsap_split_letter22" style="position: relative; display: inline-block; opacity: 1; translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate3d(0px, 0px, 0px);">d</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="gsap_split_letter gsap_split_letter23" style="position: relative; display: inline-block; opacity: 1; translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate3d(0px, 0px, 0px);">e</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="gsap_split_letter gsap_split_letter24" style="position: relative; display: inline-block; opacity: 1; translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate3d(0px, 0px, 0px);">r</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="gsap_split_letter gsap_split_letter25" style="position: relative; display: inline-block; opacity: 1; translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate3d(0px, 0px, 0px);">s</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="gsap_split_letter gsap_split_letter26" style="position: relative; display: inline-block; opacity: 1; translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate3d(0px, 0px, 0px);">.</span></span></strong></h2></div></div></div><div class="hero-special_video-card" style="translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate3d(0px, 0%, 0px);"><div class="mini-video-card_component" data-el="mini-video-card"><div class="mini-video-card_text-wrapper"><p class="mini-video-card_eyebrow">Giving day</p><h3 class="mini-video-card_title"><em>Tuesday 25 August</em></h3><div class="button_component w-variant-be415f65-fd32-4c5b-a690-3883f5e92b3a" data-link-fill-parent="0" data-size="0" data-wf--element-button--type="link"><a class="button_link w-inline-block" href="https://www.charidy.com/korowa"></a><div class="button_bg-hover"></div><div class="button_content-wrapper w-variant-be415f65-fd32-4c5b-a690-3883f5e92b3a" data-icon-position="1"><p class="button_text">Donate</p><div class="button_icon-wrapper"><span aria-hidden="true" class="icon_button" data-wf--global-button-icon--icon="arrow-right"></span></div></div></div></div><div class="mini-video-card_lightbox-wrapper w-dyn-list"><div class="display-contents w-dyn-items" role="list"><div class="display-contents w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><div class="mini-video-card_lightbox_thumb-wrap"><img alt="" class="mini-video-card_thumb" loading="lazy" src="assets/b040326e9bed8bdb_689b9231663a4f08a91a5f43_Place.svg"/><img alt="" class="mini-video-card_thumb w-dyn-bind-empty" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg"/><img alt="" class="mini-video-card_thumb" data-safari-avif-hide="" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="assets/a4549b1f9166a8e8_6a7bf7a5acbbd303ec78cb03_eDM_2.png" srcset="assets/ec33dbdcd9911320_6a7bf7a5acbbd303ec78cb03_eDM_2.png 500w, assets/7d85f45c1df2cf8f_6a7bf7a5acbbd303ec78cb03_eDM_2.png 800w, assets/a4549b1f9166a8e8_6a7bf7a5acbbd303ec78cb03_eDM_2.png 1080w"/><div class="mini-video-card_thumb-icon"><span aria-hidden="true" class="icon_svg w-variant-f21ba011-0c98-a8f8-909d-05da07789956" data-wf--global-general-icon--icon="play-filled" style="--width: 100%;"></span></div><a aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="open lightbox" class="video-lightbox-trigger w-inline-block w-lightbox" data-video-lightbox-trigger="" href="#"><script class="w-json" type="application/json">{"items":[{"url":"https://vimeo.com/1217528338?share=copy&fl=sv&fe=ci&autoplay=1","originalUrl":"https://vimeo.com/1217528338?share=copy&fl=sv&fe=ci","width":1920,"height":1080,"thumbnailUrl":"https://i.vimeocdn.com/video/2189233144-a54b714a380deac005f3cc29c6ebdf8fa19b0750a518038ef3e7cac4decb72ed-d_1280?region=us","html":"<iframe class=\"embedly-embed\" src=\"//cdn.embedly.com/widgets/media.html?src=https%3A%2F%2Fplayer.vimeo.com%2Fvideo%2F1217528338%3Fapp_id%3D122963&dntp=1&display_name=Vimeo&url=https%3A%2F%2Fvimeo.com%2F1217528338%3Fshare%3Dcopy%26fl%3Dsv%26fe%3Dci&image=https%3A%2F%2Fi.vimeocdn.com%2Fvideo%2F2189233144-a54b714a380deac005f3cc29c6ebdf8fa19b0750a518038ef3e7cac4decb72ed-d_1280%3Fregion%3Dus&type=text%2Fhtml&schema=vimeo&autoplay=1\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" scrolling=\"no\" title=\"Vimeo embed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen; encrypted-media; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen=\"true\"></iframe>&autoplay=1","type":"video"}],"group":""}</script></a></div></div></div></div><div class="component-style w-embed"><style>
